      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Virginia%E2%80%93Highland"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1971, residents founded the Virginia–Highland Civic Association to stop I‑485 construction.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Virginia%E2%80%93Highland"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The area hosts historic bungalows from the 1910s to the 1930s, making it one of Atlanta’s most architecturally historic neighborhoods.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
